BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TILE Language Party
UID:event_316527539@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053427Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T224500
SUMMARY:Toronto’s BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event Party + Bonus C
 lass by [TILE.]
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event + Class\n**Jo
 in [TILE.]** at the **most popular Saturday Language Learning Social Event
  & Party in Toronto! 🍁**\n\n**[TILE.] = Toronto International Language 
 Exchange [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tilelearning/) & [Website](
 https://www.tilelearning.com/)**\n\n**[TILE.]** now has a **2-for-1 specia
 l event\,** which includes:\n**1.** From **[6:30 - 7:15 PM](https://www.me
 etup.com/english-class-with-certified-award-winning-teacher):** An optiona
 l $5 small group 45-minute **[English language class](https://www.meetup.c
 om/english-class-with-certified-award-winning-teacher)** taught by an awar
 d-winning certified language teacher with 10+ years experience (OCT\, Univ
 ersity of Toronto PhD researcher\, MA\, BEd & HBA)\n\n**2.** From **[7:15 
 - 11 PM](https://www.meetup.com/biggest-language-party-event-social-in-tor
 onto):** Our usual huge group **[BIGGEST LANGUAGE EXCHANGE SOCIAL EVENT AN
 D PARTY IN TORONTO](https://www.meetup.com/biggest-language-party-event-so
 cial-in-toronto)** (Cost: *$5\, unless you already paid for the same day 6
 :30 English class right before\, in which which case the 7:15 social is FR
 EE)*\n\nBoth events happen Saturday on the 2nd floor of the Madison Pub (1
 4 Madison Avenue). ***Attend either or both events for $5!***\n\n**Join us
  for:**\n**✅ 💬🌎🎉 Language Exchanges and Learning in a Fun Setti
 ng**\n**✅ 🤝🗣️🥳 Meeting New Friends & Networking**\n**✅ 🃏
 🎲 🂱 Group Games & Activities**\n**✅ 🎸🎤🎧 Bonus Multilingua
 l Music (on special event days)**\n**✅ 💃🎵🕺 (Post-event) on-site
  Madison Pub Dancing\, Piano Bar\, Singing & More!**\n**✅🍔🍺🍟 On
 -site Appetizers\, Drinks and Food for Purchase at the Bar & Restaurant**\
 n\nGet your Ticket at the door OR buy a [$5 digital ticket online here](ht
 tps://www.tilelearning.com/events).\n\nMeet Toronto locals and internation
 al friends. Talk to language teachers and speakers to learn English\, Fren
 ch\, Korean\, Japanese\, Spanish\, and much more! Join us for board games\
 , conversation\, dancing\, singing\, and more! Make sure to get a nametag 
 from one of our helpers.\n\n*You **must** read the full event description 
 below before attending. By attending\, you agree to all the terms listed.*
 \n\n**[TILE.] Toronto International Language Exchange** event details:\n\n
 * We are on the 2nd floor of the Madison pub on the patio with all the int
 ernational flags! *The dance floor opens around 10 PM\, and the live piano
  bar singer start around 10:30 on the 1st floor.*\n\n**PAY** **$5** right 
 at the event by **CASH\, CREDIT\, or DEBIT**\, or **SEND $5 E-TRANSFERS** 
 to: **JOHN@TILELEARNING.COM**. You can also support the bar by buying a dr
 ink or appetizer.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER – Meetup G
 roup**\nBy attending any TILE events\, including these ones\, you acknowle
 dge and agree to the following:\n\n* *The organizers and hosts of TILE eve
 nts are are not liable for any loss\, injury\, damage\, or other unforesee
 n outcomes that may occur before\, during\, or after any event.*\n* *Parti
 cipation in TILE events is entirely voluntary and at your own risk. You ar
 e solely responsible for your own safety\, personal belongings\, transport
 ation\, behavior\, and well-being. It is your responsibility to assess the
  risks involved in any activity or location and to act accordingly.*\n* *T
 ILE and its organizers do not provide insurance and cannot guarantee the s
 afety\, accuracy of information\, or quality of venues\, third-party servi
 ces\, or other attendees.*\n* *By attending\, you release TILE\, its organ
 izers\, and affiliates from any and all claims or liability\, and you agre
 e to conduct yourself respectfully and in accordance with local laws and v
 enue rules.*\n* ***If you do not agree with this disclaimer\, please do no
 t attend TILE events.***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/tilesocial/events/316527539/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260912T144311Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260912T144311Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TILE Language Party
UID:event_316451683@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053427Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T204500
SUMMARY:Wednesday - JOIN WAITLIST -  ESL English X Korean Language Exchang
 e\, Class&Games
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event + Class\n**\\
 #\\#\\# ⚠️ If the class is listed as full\\\, PLEASE JOIN the waitlist
  and we will let guests in based on the class’ needs to balance the numb
 er of Korean & English speakers\\!**\n\n**\\#\\#\\# 👨‍🏫** **KOREAN
  X ENGLISH LANGUAGE EXCHANGE**\n\n* *****************Mini English Class wi
 th Certified Teacher + Board Games*** **🎲************\n\n**###** **⚠
 ️ Space is VERY LIMITED** **so register ASAP to save your spot!**\n\n***
 We can only accept a limited number of guests due to the venue's space lim
 itations.***\n\n**💰** **SPECIAL PROMOTION COST** **🎉:**\n**If this i
 s your first or second TILE. Event\, the class is** **FREE\, JUST buy 1 it
 em from the Café Princess Menu**\n\n**If you have already attended more t
 han 2 TILE events: pay $5 + buy any menu item from the Café Princess menu
 **\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-**\n\n**###** **📍 LOCATION: CAFÉ PRINCESS**\n\n* **5590 Yonge Stre
 et\, North York**\n* **Across the street from** **FINCH SUBWAY STATION**\n
 **near Shoppers Drug Mart**\n\n**###** ***📅*** **DAY:** ***Every*** ***
 Wednesday***\n\n* **🕡 Time: 6:30 PM – 8:45 PM** **⏰**\n\n**Please r
 egister ASAP** **if you want to attend on Sept 30th so we can save your sp
 ot!**\n\n***We had roughly 80 people sign up for the last two events... bu
 t we only have space for 30 people max.***\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-**\n**After registering\, please do the following on Sept. 30th :
 **\n\n1. **✅ Do your best to arrive on time @ Café Princess (6:30 PM)**
 \n1. **✅ Tell us whether you want to focus on learning/practicing ENGLIS
 H or KOREAN**\n1. **✅ Tell us your level: Beginner\, Intermediate\, Adva
 nced or Expert**\n1. **✅** **Buy 1 item from the Café Princess Menu** *
 *(This is the only cost if this is your 1st or 2nd class. There is an addi
 tional $5 fee starting from your third class onwards)**\n\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-**\n**✨ Popular menu items include:**\n\n* ***🍓 Strawberry Chee
 secake Bingsu***\n* ***🍧 Mango or Oreo Bingsu***\n* ***☕ Matcha & Tir
 amisu Lattes***\n* ***🧇 Princess Waffles with Ice Cream & Much More***\
 n\n**###** **What to Expect**\n\n* ***🇰🇷 Guided Korean & English lan
 guage practice***\n* ***📚 Interactive mini-lesson led by an award-winni
 ng certified teacher***\n* ***🗣️ Structured conversation activities w
 ith native and fluent speakers***\n* ***🎲 Board games and social activi
 ties to practice language naturally***\n* ***🤝 Make new friends while i
 mproving your communication skills***\n\n**👨‍🏫** **MEET YOUR TEACH
 ER & HOST**\n**###** **Learn From an Expert Language Teacher**\n\n***John 
 Dias (OCT\, PhD researcher\, MA\, BEd\, HBA & EELC) is an award-winning ce
 rtified language teacher with 10+ years experience***\n\n**###** **Who Sho
 uld Attend?**\n\n* ***English learners (ESL)***\n* ***Native Korean speake
 rs wanting to practice English***\n* ***Korean learners of all levels***\n
 * ***International students\, newcomers\, professionals\, and anyone inter
 ested in language and culture***\n\n**Feel free to** **📧** **e-mail [in
 fo@tilelearning.com](mailto:info@tilelearning.com) if you have any questio
 ns.**\n**Check out our** **🌐** **[website](https://www.tilelearning.com
 /) and [instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tilelearning/) accounts for m
 ore details.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/tilesocial/events/316451683/
